  "about": "Locker presets: 33 full outfits (6 of them for the Dominus hats, creator request) that match head to toe. Picking one puts on every piece ('-' = nothing in that slot); each piece is also in its own Locker section (e.g. Teacher Shirt, Teacher Pants, Teacher Shoes), so players can mix and match. 2.0.0-test3 (creator: \"add new presets (only purchasable with gold), existing presets stay and unlock conditions stay the same\"): unlock and need like the cosmetics sheet's: the old presets 'default' (a preset made of locked pieces is still locked until they are), the new ones 'shop' (need = the price in gold). Buying one makes every piece yours, each in its own section (their unlock is 'preset': they only come with it).",
